Acknowledgements
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The initial Vietnamese translation memory was based on kentjuno/ainovel-cli
(https://github.com/kentjuno/ainovel-cli) at commit 68eb92d.

Reference projects (ideas and patterns studied; no code copied unless noted):

  voocel/agentcore  https://github.com/voocel/agentcore
    Agent runtime used by the engine (a Go module dependency; its license is
    listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
  LingoReup Desktop  https://github.com/huuhoa143/LingoReupDesktopApp
    The Electron sidecar shell, release, signing and notarisation pipeline in
    desktop/ was adapted from LingoReup's desktop app by the same author.
  manaflow-ai/cmux  https://github.com/manaflow-ai/cmux
    Origin of the inline build -> sign -> notarise -> staple release pattern
    that the LingoReup pipeline (and therefore desktop/scripts) follows.

The packaged desktop application also bundles third-party components (Go
modules, npm packages, fonts, Electron and Chromium), each under its own
license. Their notices are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which is
generated at build time by desktop/scripts/gen-legal.sh and shipped inside the
application.
